PROJECT OVERLAY — CHANNEL INTELLIGENCE / COMMERCIAL PLANNER

## How These Rules Work

These project-specific rules apply alongside the general engineering rules
(`engineering-rules.mdc`). Both files apply simultaneously. When they conflict,
the more specific rule wins. Always read both files before starting any task.

---

## Platform Vision

Channel Intelligence Platform tracks the full stock journey:
**OEM → Distributor → Retailer → Consumer**

It ingests messy commercial files (CSV/XLSX), standardises entities via steward
workflows, and surfaces explainable recommendations across inventory, buy plans,
pricing, promotions, competition, roadmap, and budgets.

Every module follows a common pattern:
`upload → parse → map → validate → steward → apply/commit → derive`

