## Domain Language

| Term | Definition |
|---|---|
| `distributor_token` | Raw string from import file identifying a distributor before entity resolution |
| `customer_dealer_token` | Raw string from import file identifying a customer/dealer before resolution |
| `dealer_group_token` | Normalised group identifier for dealer entities across files |
| `source_key` | Natural unique key for fact table upsert |
| `provisional record` | Dimension record created with limited data, pending steward enrichment |
| `strategic customer` | Customer flagged for priority treatment in planning and allocation |
| `open channel` | Sales through unidentified end-customers; uses `OPEN_CHANNEL` dim_customer |
| `corroboration signal` | Multiple independent data sources confirming the same entity mapping |
| `historical import mode` | Bulk import with relaxed eligibility for past-period data |
| `weekly import mode` | Incremental current-period upload with strict eligibility |
| `controlled cost` | PM bottom / internal cost basis — not logistics-inclusive landed cost |
| `economics trust tier` | ok / warning / blocked classification of line economics output quality |
| `DAP` | Commercial sell-in evidence pricing — distinct from PM bottom and landed cost |

