## Import Pipeline Pattern
template_definitions.py   → Define expected columns and field types
field_mapping.py          → Map source columns to target fields (auto + manual)
import_service.py         → Parse file, apply mappings, validate rows, stage
steward_ops.py            → Flag unmapped entities for human review
apply path                → Upsert validated rows to fact tables via source_key

The steward workflow is not optional. Every unmapped entity must go through
steward review before being committed to master data. This is a governance
boundary — not a performance optimisation.

