## Fact Table Design Principles

- `source_key` uniqueness prevents duplicate rows across re-imports
- Latest-job-wins for shipment facts (`fact_inbound_shipment`) — re-importing
  updates existing rows via ON CONFLICT (source_key) DO UPDATE
- Transaction-immutability for sell-out and customer sales — update only
  resolution FKs (product_id, customer_id, store_id), never transaction data
  (quantity, price, date)
- `fact_inbound_shipment` — current truth layer for inbound shipments
- `fact_sales_sellout` — current truth layer for distributor sell-out (DSI)
- `fact_customer_sales` — current truth layer for retailer sell-out
- All fact tables handle missing data gracefully — return `data_unavailable`
  rather than errors when tables are empty or queries return null

