## Background Task Pattern

- **Primary:** Celery + Redis
- **Fallback:** Daemon thread (when `CIP_DEV_CELERY_DISPATCH=in_process_thread`)
- Every background task must register with the activity feed via
  `BackgroundTaskStore` — never run silent background tasks
- Task progress emitted via `on_progress` callback to the store
- Activity feed bell icon in nav shows real-time progress to the user

